<section class="ap-family-section">
  <div class="ap-section-header ap-section-header-stack">
    <div>
      <p class="ap-kicker">Profile choice</p>
      <h2>Which profile should I choose?</h2>
    </div>
    <p>Most coffees can work well with multiple profiles. These are the easiest starting points.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="ap-choice-grid">
    <article class="ap-choice-card">
      <h3>Classic</h3>
      <p>Start here for older beans, supermarket beans, darker roasts, or coffees with no known roast date.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="ap-choice-card">
      <h3>Direct Lever</h3>
      <p>Use this when you want the original Automatic Pro experience with a flow-led extraction.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="ap-choice-card">
      <h3>Spring Lever</h3>
      <p>Choose this if Direct Lever loses pressure too quickly or tastes overly acidic on your setup.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
